WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.169
The most effective thing you 
can do to have&nbsp;more fun

00:00:02.605 --> 00:00:04.433
is to focus on 
its ingredients,

00:00:04.433 --> 00:00:06.949
by which I mean, do everything 
you can to fill&nbsp;your life

00:00:06.949 --> 00:00:09.609
with more moments of playfulness,
connection and flow.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.884
So by playfulness, I just mean&nbsp;
having a lighthearted attitude.

00:00:12.884 --> 00:00:14.847
When we have fun, 
our guard is down,

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:16.865
and we're not taking 
ourselves&nbsp;too seriously.

00:00:16.865 --> 00:00:20.164
Connection refers to the feeling of 
having a special, shared experience.

00:00:20.164 --> 00:00:22.414
And then&nbsp;flow is the state 
where we are so engaged

00:00:22.414 --> 00:00:24.159
and focused on 
whatever we're doing

00:00:24.159 --> 00:00:26.102
that we can&nbsp;even 
lose track of time.

00:00:26.102 --> 00:00:29.576
So to start with, reduce distractions
in order to increase flow.

00:00:29.576 --> 00:00:31.942
Anything that distracts you is 
going to kick you out of flow

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:33.726
and prevent you 
from having fun.

00:00:33.726 --> 00:00:36.374
My second suggestion, is 
to increase connection

00:00:36.862 --> 00:00:39.250
by interacting more with other 
human beings in&nbsp;real life.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.911
You might be amazed 
by how good

00:00:40.911 --> 00:00:44.069
just one little moment of 
connection can make you&nbsp;feel.

00:00:44.069 --> 00:00:45.699
And if you do find 
someone to connect with,

00:00:45.699 --> 00:00:48.177
maybe ask them to join you in 
trying my&nbsp;third suggestion,

00:00:48.177 --> 00:00:49.917
which is to increase 
playfulness

00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:52.589
by finding opportunities to rebel.

00:00:52.589 --> 00:00:53.633
I'm talking about 
finding ways to

00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:55.844
break the rules of 
responsible adulthood,

00:00:56.165 --> 00:00:59.926
and giving yourself&nbsp;permission to
 get a kick out of your own life.

